==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|zle-mru|ко́шка|sc=Cyrs}}, from {{inh|ru|orv|ко́шька}}, from unattested {{m|orv|*ко́чька}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*kòťьka}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*kòťь}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*kòtъ}}. Cognate with {{cog|zle-ort|ко́шка}}, {{cog|uk|кі́шка}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ко́шка}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-кошка.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|ко́шка|*|a=ai|m=кот,коша́к|adj=коша́чий|dim=ко́шечка|expr=кошь}}

# [[cat]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[жить]] [[как]] '''ко́шка''' [[с]] [[собака|соба́кой]]|to lead a cat-and-dog life}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[игра́ть]] [[в]] '''ко́шки'''-мышки|play cat-and-mouse}}
#: {{uxi|ru|но́чью [[весь|все]] '''ко́шки''' се́ры|at night all cats are gray}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[у]] него́ '''ко́шки''' [[скрести|скребу́т]] [[на]] [[се́рдце]]|he is sick at heart (very upset)}}
# {{lb|ru|inanimate}} [[cat-o'-nine-tails]]
# {{lb|ru|technical|inanimate}} [[grapnel]], [[drag]]
# {{lb|ru|technical|inanimate}} [[grapple]] [[fork]]
# {{lb|ru|cranes|inanimate}} [[car]], [[trolley]], [[carriage]]
# {{lb|ru|geology|inanimate}} [[spit]], [[bar]]
# {{lb|ru|climbing|in the plural|inanimate}} {{topics|ru|Footwear}} [[crampon]]s, [[climbing]] [[irons]], [[climbing]] [[grapplers]]

